#: memory.cpp:196
msgid ""
"This graph gives you an overview of the <b>usage of physical memory</b> in "
"your system."
"<p>Most operating systems (including Linux) will use as much of the "
"available physical memory as possible as disk cache, to speed up the system "
"performance. "
